{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01Dn6eSU32AqpXQJDJ2baUjx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JW9zkhDLrmZPChvXEX4Qdz","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 -m pytest engine_tests/ -q 2>&1 | tail -2\ncat >> /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md << 'EOF'\n\n## sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex\n- Restricted mana gap: added `_restricted` tracking to `ManaPool` plus an\n  `instant_or_sorcery` flag on `can_pay`/`pay` (default True = backward compat);\n  `cast_spell` passes the real spell type. Restricted mana is excluded when\n  paying for anything that isn't an instant/sorcery (creatures, the {5} ability).\n- Animation: in-place mutation of the Land instance (adds CREATURE type, 2/4,\n  Wizard, base/plain P/T). Bakes CREATURE into `_original_card_types` and\n  overrides the instance `_reset_characteristics` so EffectManager.apply_all()\n  resets P/T to base while preserving the (permanent) animation.\n- Pump \"+1/+0 until EOT\": a DURATION_END_OF_TURN ContinuousEffect per cast;\n  the trigger calls apply_all() so the pump is observable immediately (engine\n  otherwise recalculates continuous effects only at cleanup).\nEOF\nsed -i 's/- \\[ \\] \\*\\*sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex\\*\\*/- [x] **sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex**/' /workspace/TODO.md\ngit add -A && git commit -q -m \"sos_257: Great Hall of the Biblioplex\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\" && echo DONE","description":"Guard, log, commit sos_257"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1033,"cache_read_input_tokens":278216,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1033},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4fef623c-942b-4e62-9572-a